<title>USA: NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-REVISED ORDER OF FIRST ROUND OF THE NFL DRAFT.</title>
<headline>NFL AMERICAN FOOTBALL-REVISED ORDER OF FIRST ROUND OF THE NFL DRAFT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Revised order of the NFL</p>
<p>Draft starting Saturday following the New York Jets' trade of</p>
<p>the first overall choice to the St Louis Rams in return for</p>
<p>four picks:</p>
<p>1. St. Louis from New York Jets (1-13)</p>
<p>2. Oakland from New Orleans (3-13)</p>
<p>3. Seattle from Atlanta (3-13)</p>
<p>4. Baltimore (4-12)</p>
<p>5. Detroit (5-11)</p>
<p>6. New York Jets from St. Louis (6-10)</p>
<p>7. New York Giants (6-10)</p>
<p>8. Tampa Bay (6-10)</p>
<p>9. Arizona (7-9)</p>
<p>10. New Orleans from Oakland (7-9)</p>
<p>11. Atlanta from Chicago through Seattle (7-9)</p>
<p>12. Seattle (7-9)</p>
<p>13. Houston (8-8)</p>
<p>14. Cincinnati (8-8)</p>
<p>15. Miami (8-8)</p>
<p>16. Tampa Bay from San Diego (8-8)</p>
<p>17. Washington (9-7)</p>
<p>18. Kansas City (9-7)</p>
<p>19. Indianapolis (9-7)</p>
<p>20. Minnesota (9-7)</p>
<p>21. Jacksonville (9-7)</p>
<p>22. Philadelphia (10-6)</p>
<p>23. Buffalo (10-6)</p>
<p>24. Pittsburgh (10-6)</p>
<p>25. Dallas (10-6)</p>
<p>26. San Francisco (12-4)</p>
<p>27. Carolina (12-4)</p>
<p>28. Denver (13-3)</p>
<p>29. New England (11-5)</p>
<p>30. Green Bay (13-3)</p>
</text>
